# /bicycle-ontology/
# Bicycle ontology used in the TDCC-NES ontology training.
# Project: https://github.com/TDCC-NES/ontology-training
# Maintainer: Kathrin Füllenbach
# GitHub username: kathrinrin

RewriteEngine On
Header always merge Vary Accept

RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} text/turtle [NC]
RewriteRule ^(?:(?:def|id)(?:/[^/]*)?)?$ https://tdcc-nes.github.io/ontology-training/main/bicycle-ontology.ttl [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^(?:(?:def|id)(?:/[^/]*)?)?$ https://tdcc-nes.github.io/ontology-training/main/bicycle-ontology.html [R=303,L]
